The step this chapter leaves open is the one that motivated the hybrid in the first place. Methods that find noisy labels by comparing each label with its neighbors' labels rest on the same distance studied here. Chapter~\ref{chap:noise} tests whether the hybrid's distance makes noisy labels easier to find and to act on.



