Inverse & Weight & $1 / (1 + \alpha\,\tilde s_i)$ \\
Exponential & Weight & $\exp(-\alpha\,\tilde s_i)$ \\
Soft & Weight & $1 - \alpha\,\tilde s_i^{\,2}$, clipped to $[0.1, 1]$ \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
